Description: shared long-term memory for coding agents (MCP server)
 An MCP server that lets coding agents such as Claude Code and Codex save
 memories and techniques that other agent sessions can search and reuse.
 .
 It speaks the Model Context Protocol over Streamable HTTP and stores
 entries in MongoDB. There is no built-in authentication; restrict access
 at the network level.
